NestJS Service Tests with Fake
Repositories
TaskFlow - Full Stack Developer 2026

What this layer proves
TasksService tests prove application orchestration: which repository calls happen, how business rules are
applied, and which application exceptions are produced. They should not verify Prisma syntax.

Use the repository seam from Phase 24
